-- New-car price list: per-variant spec sheets (data only, no schema change).
-- The car page showed little more than engine/power/torque/seats for a new
-- Proton or Perodua. This adds, per variant: dimensions, weight, boot, fuel tank,
-- economy (km/L), 0-100, wheels/tyres, airbag count, NCAP, active-safety list,
-- key equipment list, colours, factory warranty (+ battery warranty for EV/PHEV),
-- charging (EV), spec_source and specs_checked.
-- Source: paultan.org research spec sheets, one page per variant, read 2026-10-08
-- (spec_source holds each URL). Fields a page did not state are left out.
-- Merge rule: new || specs, so values already in specs (power_ps, torque_nm,
-- seats, battery_kwh, range_km, engine) are NOT overwritten.
-- Regional prices were deliberately not touched here (paultan's research pages
-- lag behind price cuts; see TODO).

